    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>At 2nd level your training as a Gladiator has made you very difficult to intimidate or deter. For a number of times equal to half your Gladiator level (Rounded down) per encounter, you may add your Gladiator level to either your <a href=\"/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> (And <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a>), or <a href=\"/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> until the start of your next turn as a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>; you can choose which <a href=\"/wiki/Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense\">Defense</a> to apply the bonus to when you use the ability, but you must declare the use of this feature before you know the outcome of the effect targeting you.</p>",
